{"4903780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Office Cleanup Co.", "steam_appid": 4903780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mountains of trash have stacked up in this office over the years and it's your job as the janitor to pick it up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleaning Up The Place</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slowly but surely collect trash by hand and throw it away in garbage cans in order to get <strong>money</strong>. Then using that money purchase <strong>upgrades</strong> like bigger trash bags, vacuum robots, a backpack garbage sucker, and more! Work your way through each office floor until you reach the very top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903780/extras/97f5e81b446c3b88eba5ff5a3ded4f8e.poster.avif?t=1786324653\" width=1170 height=672 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903780/extras/97f5e81b446c3b88eba5ff5a3ded4f8e.webm?t=1786324653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903780/extras/97f5e81b446c3b88eba5ff5a3ded4f8e.mp4?t=1786324653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Items</strong> - Use multiple items  like your <strong>hands</strong>, a <strong>broom</strong>, a backpack <strong>sucker</strong>, automatic <strong>vacuum</strong> robots, and more to collect all the trash in the office.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Levels</strong> - Includes multiple office floors with different settings to work your way through and clean. Rooms like cafeterias, conference rooms, and offices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Tracks</strong> - Relax and clean to a series of calming jazz beats that play through speakers in the hallways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903780/extras/ee32fe31040d75802d01ac0390524df1.poster.avif?t=1786324653\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903780/extras/ee32fe31040d75802d01ac0390524df1.webm?t=1786324653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903780/extras/ee32fe31040d75802d01ac0390524df1.mp4?t=1786324653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mountains of trash have stacked up in this office over the years and it's your job as the janitor to pick it up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleaning Up The Place</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slowly but surely collect trash by hand and throw it away in garbage cans in order to get <strong>money</strong>. Then using that money purchase <strong>upgrades</strong> like bigger trash bags, vacuum robots, a backpack garbage sucker, and more! Work your way through each office floor until you reach the very top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4903780/extras/97f5e81b446c3b88eba5ff5a3ded4f8e.poster.avif?t=1786324653\" width=1170 height=672 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a